### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/healthz

### Create Vector Store
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/vector_stores
Content-Type: application/json
x-svs-tenant-id: ten_dev
x-svs-business-instance-id: biz_dev
x-svs-user-id: usr_dev
x-svs-groups: grp_admin,grp_eng
x-svs-roles: owner,admin
x-svs-max-security-level: 5

{"name":"Dev Store","knowledge_base_id":"kb_dev","attributes":{"env":"dev"}}

### Ingest external PDF-to-Markdown output
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/documents/ingest
Content-Type: application/json
x-svs-tenant-id: ten_dev
x-svs-business-instance-id: biz_dev
x-svs-user-id: usr_dev
x-svs-groups: grp_admin,grp_eng
x-svs-roles: owner,admin
x-svs-max-security-level: 5

{
  "vector_store_id":"vs_dev",
  "knowledge_base_id":"kb_dev",
  "title":"Converted PDF Example",
  "filename":"converted.md",
  "mime_type":"text/markdown",
  "mode":"pdf_markdown_external_v1",
  "content":"# Contract\n\n<!-- page: 1 -->\nPayment terms are net 30.",
  "security_level":1,
  "attributes":{"source_pdf_id":"pdf_external_001"}
}

### Hybrid retrieve
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/retrieval/search
Content-Type: application/json
x-svs-tenant-id: ten_dev
x-svs-business-instance-id: biz_dev
x-svs-user-id: usr_dev
x-svs-groups: grp_admin,grp_eng
x-svs-roles: owner,admin
x-svs-max-security-level: 5

{"query":"What are the payment terms?","vector_store_id":"vs_dev","mode":"pdf_markdown_external_v1","top_k":5}

### Context pack
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/retrieval/context-pack
Content-Type: application/json
x-svs-tenant-id: ten_dev
x-svs-business-instance-id: biz_dev
x-svs-user-id: usr_dev
x-svs-groups: grp_admin,grp_eng
x-svs-roles: owner,admin
x-svs-max-security-level: 5

{"query":"What are the payment terms?","vector_store_id":"vs_dev","max_context_tokens":2000}
